   "line": 2,
   "text": "Instead, a ghost glides down to where voices live, swelling and fading: nine percent at thirty-five hundred hertz, five at three thousand, two at one thousand. And voices near thirty-five hundred come out louder. How can a filter that only multiplies and adds make anything louder?",
