  {
   "line": 10,
   "text": "Your line leaves the top of its band empty, so the slope can land there. Pass up to thirty-four hundred hertz within one percent, remove above forty-six hundred to below one percent. The plain cut needs two hundred seventy-one coefficients. Your chip affords forty-seven. Hamming at forty-five: point two four percent on both. The ghost is gone.",
